@prefix semi: <urn:pxai:semi:> .
@prefix owl: <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#> .
@prefix rdfs: <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#> .

<urn:pxai:semi:organization> a owl:Ontology ; owl:imports <urn:pxai:semi:common> .

semi:Organization a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf semi:Entity .
semi:Department a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf semi:Organization .
semi:Role a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf semi:InformationEntity .
semi:Shift a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf semi:InformationEntity .
semi:Person a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf semi:PhysicalEntity .
semi:Supplier a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf semi:Organization .

semi:memberOf a owl:ObjectProperty ; rdfs:domain semi:Person ; rdfs:range semi:Organization .
semi:hasRole a owl:ObjectProperty ; rdfs:domain semi:Person ; rdfs:range semi:Role .
semi:responsibleFor a owl:ObjectProperty ; rdfs:domain semi:Role ; rdfs:range semi:Entity .
semi:workedOnShift a owl:ObjectProperty ; rdfs:domain semi:Person ; rdfs:range semi:Shift .
